\section{Basic Machine Organization}
\subsection{Registers}

Registers are an array of D flip-flops which can store a collection of bits.

An n bit register has n inputs, n outputs, and one clock line.

\begin{center}
<chn>   \includegraphics[height=2.5in]{hwio_figs/00156.eps}   \\
<s>   \includegraphics[height=2.5in]{hwio_figs/00156.eps}   \\

\end{center}

<s>\end{slide}
<s>\begin{slide}

\subsection{Busses}

A bus is a parallel bi-directional data path

Multiple devices can send and receive on one bus

\begin{center}
<chn>   \includegraphics[height=2.5in]{hwio_figs/00155.eps}   \\
<s>   \includegraphics[width=\textwidth]{hwio_figs/00155.eps}   \\
\end{center}

Address: N bits which specify {\it which location}.

Data:   Contents to/from memory or I/O device

Control:  'traffic signals'

<s>\end{slide}
<s>\begin{slide}


More detailed view:

Address Comparator

\begin{itemize}
 \item A combinatorial logic circuit at each device
 \item 2 $n$-bit binary inputs:
   \begin{enumerate}
          \item ADDR bus (changing)
          \item Device address (fixed)
    \end{enumerate}

 \item Control input
 \item Output = 1 iff input1 == input2
\end{itemize}

<s>\end{slide}
<s>\begin{slide}

Control bus is gated by ADDR comparator

Device register is strobed by CTL pulse only if addresses match.

\begin{center}
<chn>   \includegraphics[height=2.5in]{hwio_figs/00157.eps}   \\
<s>   \includegraphics[width=\textwidth]{hwio_figs/00157.eps}   \\
\end{center}



<s>\end{slide}
<s>\begin{slide}

Bus Logic Notation:

Below is a simple notation for showing timing relationships of signals on
busses.

\begin{center}
<chn>   \includegraphics[height=2.5in]{hwio_figs/00158.eps}   \\
<s>   \includegraphics[width=\textwidth]{hwio_figs/00158.eps}   \\

\end{center}

Problem:  How can multiple logic outputs be connected to the
same wire?

Solution:  Tri-state logic.

\begin{center}
<chn>   \includegraphics[height=2.0in]{hwio_figs/00159.eps}   \\
<s>   \includegraphics[height=1.5in]{hwio_figs/00159.eps}   \\
\end{center}
States:  { Logic 1, Logic 0, switch OFF }

CPU and all devices can ``talk'' on data bus.

Only {\bf ONE} device my have the tri-state switch closed at
any time!

<s>\end{slide}
